@startuml
title UC05 - View Daily Agenda (PetWise MVP)\nInfrastructure + Application + Domain

actor User as U  <<Attendant/Manager>>
participant "AppointmentController\n(infrastructure)" as C
participant "DefaultViewDailyAgendaUseCase\n(application)" as UC
participant "AppointmentGateway\n(port)" as GApp
participant "AppointmentPostgresGateway\n(adapter)" as AApp
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

== Happy Path: View Agenda ==

U -> C : GET /appointments/agenda\n?date=YYYY-MM-DD&status=&serviceType=&page=&perPage=
C -> C : Build ViewDailyAgendaCommand
C -> UC : execute(command)

UC -> UC : Build AppointmentSearchQuery\n(date → UTC Instant range)
UC -> GApp : findDailyAgenda(query)
GApp -> AApp : findDailyAgenda(query)
AApp -> DB : SELECT * FROM appointments\nWHERE start_at >= ? AND start_at < ?\nAND status/serviceType filters...
DB --> AApp : result set (0..n rows)
AApp --> GApp : Pagination<Appointment>
GApp --> UC : Pagination<Appointment>

UC --> UC : map → Pagination<ViewDailyAgendaOutput>
UC --> C : Pagination<ViewDailyAgendaOutput>
C --> C : map → Pagination<AppointmentResponse>
C --> U : 200 OK\nJSON paginated list

== Alternative: No Appointments ==

U -> C : GET /appointments/agenda?date=2026-12-25
C -> UC : execute(command)
UC -> GApp : findDailyAgenda(query)
GApp -> AApp : query
AApp -> DB : SELECT ... (no rows)
DB --> AApp : empty result set
AApp --> GApp : Pagination(empty)
GApp --> UC : Pagination(empty)
UC --> C : empty page
C --> U : 200 OK with empty list

== Alternative: Missing Date ==

U -> C : GET /appointments/agenda
C --> U : 400 Bad Request\n(required parameter 'date' missing)

@enduml
